2081,"[""Man, don't you hate when you have a test coming up and you procrastinate studying?"", 'Yes.. I have a test coming up and I should be studying right now!  LOL', ""Hahaha, well, this is a pretty good use of your time as well though! But yea, it's so much easier when you study ahead of time. I don't know why I don't do it more often, lol.""]",They say some of the smartest people are procrastinators.,"One time I had a test to take. I studied and studied and got myself ready for it. When it came time to take it, it felt extremely easy.",prepared,[None],[None]
2108,"[""I've lost my job and am behind on my mortgage. It scares me that I could lose my home."", ""That's awful, I'm sorry to hear that. I lost my job once as well and times got really hard. What kind of stuff are you doing to try and avoid that outcome?"", ""Thank you. I've been working odd and ends and am looking for a job that pays more of course. How did you overcome that time?""]","Well, at the time I was holding out for a similar paying job like I had before but I could not find one and I ended up working fast food. I had to downsize my place as well.",I've lost my job and am behind on my mortgage. It scares me that I could lose my home.,terrified,[None],[None]
