11564,"[""Learned earlier today that I had been drinking all day out of a cup that had been used earlier by someone who has bronchitis. I'm hoping it's not too contagious... Why can't people properly clean and put things away so I don't confuse dirty dishes with clean dishes!"", ""People can be inconsiderate sometimes. I hope you don't get sick!"", ""Well, we'll see. I'm generally pretty healthy and haven't been to the doctor in like over 6 years for anything other than the flu. So, hopefully my immune system will keep it at bay. But it was just it's something so simple and avoidable, and they didn't do it. I guess I should feel more empathy for them though, since they're sick.""]",That's true. It's nice of you to put yourself in their shoes.,Learned earlier today that I had been drinking all day out of a cup that had been used earlier by someone who has bronchitis. I'm hoping it's not too contagious... Why can't people properly clean and put things away so I don't confuse dirty dishes with clean dishes!,disgusted,[None],"I'm in a positive mood, please congratulate me and praise me."
