30101,"['I was stuck home the other day with the flu.', 'Oh man, the flu in summer?1', 'Right?! I was miserable, stuck all day in bed.', 'Oh geez! Was it a quick flu', 'It was, but I am very grateful to my wife. She let me rest all day, and brought me food and drinks to be as comfortable as possible. :)', ""Wow! Great wife, Cherish her! Stack up on good vitamin C and good Elderberry when you're well to keep the flu away :)\\"", 'Thank you! Hopefully you can avoid it this year.']",Oh god...lol- I HATE being sick...When I get sick..it's BAD- So let's hope lol,"When I stayed home sick with the flu, my wife let me stay in bed and took care of me.",content,[None],"I'm in a negative mood, please comfort me."
